  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"buttons\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">−</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --accent-dark: #b83a4f;\n  --btn-bg: #0f3460;\n  --btn-hover: #1a4a7a;\n  --btn-active: #0a2a4a;\n  --focus: #f9c74f;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  background-color: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background-color: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--accent-dark);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 5rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--accent-dark);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--text);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  background-color: var(--btn-bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.1s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--btn-active);\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background-color: var(--btn-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(4px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n  background-color: var(--btn-active);\n}\n\nbutton#reset {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3.5rem;\n  }\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  button {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    min-width: 56px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count is 0.\n- Increase button adds 1.\n- Decrease button subtracts 1.\n- Reset button sets count back to 0.\n- Supports negative numbers.\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with ARIA labels.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use keyboard navigation (Tab to focus, Enter/Space to activate) to change the count.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and required IDs (`count`, `increase`, `decrease`, `reset`).\n- `style.css` — pixel-art theme, responsive layout, focus/hover/active states.\n- `script.js` — counter logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Total source under 200 lines.\n- No external assets, imports, packages, or server code.\n- Styling does not override required IDs, text, or behavior.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
